<% content_for :title, "Privacy Policy" %>
<% content_for :description, "How Grouparty handles your data: what we store when you play, the cookies we use, and how Google AdSense shows ads." %>
<% link = "text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 underline" %>

<div class="min-h-screen py-12 px-4 sm:px-6">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-slate-300 leading-relaxed space-y-8">
    <%= render "pages/header", title: "Privacy Policy", subtitle: "Last updated: October 9, 2026" %>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains what information <%= SeoHelper::SITE_NAME %> (“we”, “us”) collects when you
        visit or play on this website, how it is used, and the choices you have. <%= SeoHelper::SITE_NAME %> is run
        by Daniel Arenas. If you have any question, write to
        <%= mail_to PagesController::CONTACT_EMAIL, nil, class: link %>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">1. Information we collect</h2>
      <p>You don't need an account to use <%= SeoHelper::SITE_NAME %>. We only store what the games need to work:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong class="text-white">Nickname:</strong> the name you type when you join a room. It is shown to the other people in that room. Please don't use your full real name or any sensitive information as a nickname.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-white">Game data:</strong> the room code, the game settings, and what happens during the game (answers, scores, moves). This is used to run the game and show results.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-white">Technical data:</strong> like most websites, our servers record basic request logs (IP address, browser type, pages requested, date and time) to keep the service running, fix errors and prevent abuse.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We don't ask for your email, phone number, location or payment details, and we don't sell your personal information.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">2. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use a small number of cookies:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong class="text-white">Essential cookies:</strong> a session cookie remembers which player you are in a room, so you can reload the page or reconnect without losing your place. The game can't work without it.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-white">Preference cookie:</strong> remembers the language you picked (English or Spanish), so the site opens in that language next time.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-white">Advertising cookies:</strong> set by Google and its partners when ads are shown (see the next section).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. If you block essential cookies, you won't be able to join a game.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">3. Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
      <p>
        To keep <%= SeoHelper::SITE_NAME %> free, we use Google AdSense to show ads. Google and other third-party
        vendors use cookies to serve ads based on your previous visits to this website and other websites.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this and other sites on the Internet.</li>
        <li>You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's <%= link_to "Ads Settings", "https://adssettings.google.com", class: link, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>.</li>
        <li>You can also opt out of some third-party vendors' use of cookies for personalized advertising at <%= link_to "www.aboutads.info", "https://www.aboutads.info/choices/", class: link, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>.</li>
        <li>Learn more in <%= link_to "How Google uses information from sites or apps that use its services", "https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites", class: link, target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Visitors in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and Switzerland are asked for consent before
        personalized ads are shown, and can change their choice at any time.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">4. How we use information</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li>To create rooms, connect players and run the games in real time.</li>
        <li>To show scores, results and leaderboards to the people in the same room.</li>
        <li>To keep the website secure, find bugs and improve the games.</li>
        <li>To show ads that help pay for the service.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">5. How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        Players who leave a room are removed from it shortly after they disconnect. Room data (room code,
        settings, nicknames and scores) stays in our database after the game ends, and is only used to run the
        service. Server logs are used only for security and troubleshooting. You can ask us to delete data related
        to a room at any time by writing to
        <%= mail_to PagesController::CONTACT_EMAIL, nil, class: link %>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">6. Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We don't sell or rent your information. Data is shared only with the service providers that help us run
        the site (hosting and database providers), with Google for advertising as described above, or when
        required by law.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">7. Children</h2>
      <p>
        <%= SeoHelper::SITE_NAME %> is a general-audience website and is not directed at children under 13. We don't
        knowingly collect personal information from children. Games are often played in family settings; in that
        case, an adult should host the room. If you believe a child has given us personal information, contact us
        and we will delete it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">8. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on where you live (for example under the GDPR in Europe or the CCPA in California), you may have
        the right to access, correct or delete your personal information, or to object to how it is used. To make a
        request, email <%= mail_to PagesController::CONTACT_EMAIL, nil, class: link %>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">9. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when it was
        last changed.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>

  <%= ad_slot :page, css: "max-w-3xl mx-auto mt-12" %>
</div>
